---
// Çok İleri Derece İşitme Kaybı —
// /ihtiyaciniza-gore/cok-ileri-derece-isitme-kaybi. Fourth and final
// degree page in the "İhtiyacınıza Göre" series' dB ladder (see
// header.data.ts's devicesMega third column), built directly on the
// Hafif / Orta / İleri Derece İşitme Kaybı master templates — same
// shared, data-driven Brand Component Architecture, same
// KulakArkasiComparison component (already generic, reused as-is), same
// accent-scoping pattern with its own koyu kehribar/deep amber (#92400e)
// category accent — deliberately dark and weighty, distinct from the
// small-scale warning-badge amber (#d97706) used contextually across
// every Considerations section.
//
// A health-classification topic, handled with the same care as the
// sibling degree pages and the Tinnitus page: self-diagnosis is never
// implied, and every section (Nedir?, Belirtiler, Dikkat Edilmesi
// Gerekenler, Uzman Yorumu, FAQ) routes back to a proper audiometric test
// (odyometri) as the only way to confirm degree and type. This page's one
// real departure from its three siblings: at this degree, evaluation is
// explicitly framed as a joint process with an ENT (KBB) specialist, and
// Considerations/FAQ factually (and cautiously) note that cochlear
// implantation becomes a relevant option for some profound-loss users —
// always hedged, always pointing to an ENT/CI-center evaluation, never
// claiming this clinic provides that pathway.
//
// 14-section flow, in order: Hero -> Nedir? + Nasıl Anlaşılır? ->
// Günlük Yaşamdaki Belirtiler -> Avantajları -> Dikkat Edilmesi
// Gerekenler -> Derecelere Göre (Çok İleri Derecenin Yeri, completing the
// ladder) -> Öne Çıkan Özellikler -> Teknolojiler -> Önerilen Marka ve
// Modeller -> En Yüksek Kapasiteli Power BTE vs Standart Güçlü BTE ->
// Uzman Yorumu -> SSS -> Premium CTA -> İlgili İçerikler.
// (Same repurposing as the sibling degree pages for the "Kimler İçin
// Uygun" and hearing-loss-level slots; see evolution.ts and
// ideal-user.ts. The comparison table is this page's other departure:
// since there's no fifth degree to compare forward to, and repeating the
// İleri page's "İleri vs Çok İleri" table with sides swapped would be
// redundant, this table instead compares WITHIN the power-BTE category
// itself — same technique the Şarjlı Teknolojiler page used for its own
// within-category comparison.)
